{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027200029046-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027215804\"/><p>今晚(27日)第115期六合彩攪珠結果：2、4、18、21、24、47，特別號碼為31。頭獎無人中；二獎2注中，每注派彩1,110,950港元；三獎83.5注中，每注派彩70,950港元。</p><p>提提大家，嚟緊周四(10月29日)不會舉行攪珠，下期六合彩萬聖節金多寶攪珠將於周六(10月31日)舉行，特設6000萬港元金多寶，若以10港元一注獨中，估計頭獎基金可達8000萬港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:41.810781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:58:25.180302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:37.056985+00:00","content_hash":"912643f9eee817c4cb212f53f840d8b42255b0c950c8390353dcbf7af6b8c8a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}